14
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,012
reranking, or combinations.

15
00:00:36,174 --> 00:00:38,769
Ask where meaning enters its pipeline.

16
00:00:39,702 --> 00:00:41,681
Search for heart attack treatment.

17
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:44,426
A document says myocardial infarction

18
00:00:44,446 --> 00:00:46,862
therapy. Expansion can add those

19
00:00:46,882 --> 00:00:49,607
expressions so a lexical retriever has

20
00:00:49,627 --> 00:00:51,050
matching terms.

21
00:00:51,212 --> 00:00:54,014
A suitably trained dense retriever may

22
00:00:54,034 --> 00:00:56,540
bridge the original phrasings through

23
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,892
vector comparison.

24
00:00:58,446 --> 00:01:01,009
A third route first uses expansion and

25
00:01:01,029 --> 00:01:04,036
