34
00:01:24,287 --> 00:01:26,947
about unrealistic expectations.

35
00:01:27,135 --> 00:01:29,872
That vocabulary bridge is valuable.

36
00:01:30,047 --> 00:01:32,218
But a single-vector passage encoder

37
00:01:32,238 --> 00:01:34,564
compresses the passage before it knows

38
00:01:34,584 --> 00:01:36,341
what the next query will ask.

39
00:01:36,892 --> 00:01:39,433
Broad similarity can dominate an exact

40
00:01:39,453 --> 00:01:42,615
code, a rare name or a negation.

41
00:01:42,790 --> 00:01:45,192
Shorter chunks reduce the compression,

42
00:01:45,393 --> 00:01:47,757
while each chunk still has one pooled

43
00:01:47,777 --> 00:01:50,567
vector. Similar meaning alone does not

44
00:01:50,587 --> 00:01:53,414
establish suitability for a task or

45
00:01:53,434 --> 00:01:54,909
inclusion criteria.

46
00:01:55,822 --> 00:01:58,523
A range search can return vectors above a

47
00:01:58,543 --> 00:02:00,146
similarity threshold.

48
00:02:00,308 --> 00:02:02,620
The difficulty is calibration.

49
00:02:02,782 --> 00:02:05,559
Scores vary across queries, models and

50
00:02:05,579 --> 00:02:08,523
collections. One fixed threshold may

51
00:02:08,543 --> 00:02:11,010
return nothing for one search and

52
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:12,465
thousands for another.

53
00:02:13,001 --> 00:02:15,405
A fixed k gives a more predictable output

54
00:02:15,425 --> 00:02:18,368
size, not a guarantee that every returned

55
00:02:18,388 --> 00:02:19,914
item is useful.

56
00:02:20,077 --> 00:02:22,415
A similarity score needs the context of

57
00:02:22,435 --> 00:02:24,450
its model and comparison rule.

58
00:02:24,613 --> 00:02:26,655
It is not a calibrated probability of

59
00:02:26,675 --> 00:02:27,556
relevance.

60
00:02:28,459 --> 00:02:30,856
Our invented pipeline retrieves forty

61
00:02:30,876 --> 00:02:33,653
candidates, passes eight to an answer

62
00:02:33,673 --> 00:02:36,861
writer, and displays three citations.

63
00:02:37,023 --> 00:02:39,284
These numbers are teaching budgets, not

64
00:02:39,304 --> 00:02:41,088
